/Title (Digital Twin \(DT\) technology provides a dynamic, virtual replica of physical entities synchronized through bidirectional data streaming pipelines. While heavily researched in aerospace and smart manufacturing, the application of digital twin paradigms to human physiological telemetry and musculoskeletal biomechanics presents severe engineering challenges due to biological non-linearities, high-frequency spatial tracking requirements, and complex sensory fusion.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1358 0 R
/Next 1444 0 R
>>
