1430 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Human Body Digital Twin Simulator successfully demonstrates a cost-effective, high-precision cyber- physical framework bridging physical human telemetry with real-time computational biomechanics. By integrating ESP32 edge processing nodes, 9-DOF inertial sensing, PPG pulse oximetry, surface electromyography, and high-performance WebGL 3D rendering engines, the system achieves sub-35 ms synchronization latency with high kinematic tracking accuracy \(>97.2%\).)
/Dest [29 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1360 0 R
/Next 1452 0 R
>>
